Outside folds in code from other BSD 2-Clause plugins. Their notices, as their licences ask:

Encounter Recorder (github.com/mrgnomnom/encounter-recorder, by Mr Gnome; the Plugin Hub's commit 3570026),
ported into Outside's encounters on 11/21/2026: Encounters.java (its EncounterRecorderPlugin.java and Names.java),
EncounterSnap.java (its Snap.java) and EncounterFiles.java (its Recording.java, Compressed.java and Recordings.java).
Outside writes its file format (its docs/FORMAT.md, format 6), so recordings made by either play in the other's replay.

